<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_6_1" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_6_1">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_6_1" name="3.6.1 Makeup Water Supply" processRef="Process_L3_3_6_1"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_6_1" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. Brings new water to the site from the configured source — seawater, surface water, groundwater or a third-party supply — treats it where required, disposes of any treatment residue, and conveys it to site storage. "Makeup", "fresh" and "desalinated" water are different concepts; the source type is configuration.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_6_1">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_6_1_wat" name="Water Operator / DCS / SCADA">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_6_1_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_6_1_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Par_L3_3_6_1_f</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_6_1_g2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_6_1_e1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_6_1_e2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_1_n</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_6_1_e3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_6_1_s" name="Makeup water demand">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_1" name="3.6.1.1 Abstract Raw Water">
      <bpmn:documentation>Raw water is drawn from the configured source — seawater intake, river or lake, borefield, or a third-party connection — within the permitted abstraction limits. [WATER: volume (abstracted) | source meter | continuous | MCA WAF | YES — water input boundary; WP-01]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: DCS / SCADA; Water Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: water_flow_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g" name="Treatment required?" default="Flow_L3_3_6_1_4">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_2" name="3.6.1.2 Treat Raw Water">
      <bpmn:documentation>Raw water is treated to the quality the site needs — for example desalination of seawater, or filtration and softening of surface water. Conditional — only where the source needs treatment. Plant availability and output are monitored. [WATER: volume (treated water produced) | product meter | continuous | MCA WAF | NO — WP-02]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: DCS / SCADA; Water Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: water_flow_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:parallelGateway id="Par_L3_3_6_1_f">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_6</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:parallelGateway>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_4" name="3.6.1.4 Convey Makeup Water to Site">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pump stations and pipeline move makeup water to site. Pumped and received volumes are compared to detect transfer losses or meter faults; any shared use of the supply system (an allocation boundary) is recorded. [WATER: volume and flow (pumped) | pump station flow meters | continuous | MCA WAF | NO — transfer within the supply system]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS / SCADA; Water Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: water_flow_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_5" name="3.6.1.5 Receive and Store Makeup Water">
      <bpmn:documentation>Makeup water is received into site storage, from which process water is blended (3.6.4). The receipt meter is the site boundary for makeup water. [WATER: volume (received) | receipt meter | continuous | MCA WAF | YES — site receipt boundary; WP-04]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS / SCADA
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: water_flow_telemetry); Curated (water_transfer_record)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_10</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g2" name="Transfer volumes reconcile?" default="Flow_L3_3_6_1_11">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_11</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_12</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_6_1_e1" name="Makeup water in site storage">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_11</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_3" name="3.6.1.3 Dispose of Treatment Residue">
      <bpmn:documentation>Residue from treatment — for example brine from desalination, or sludge — is disposed of under its discharge permit; volume and quality are reported. Conditional — only where treatment produces a residue. [WATER: volume (residue discharged) | flow meter | continuous | MCA WAF | YES — water output boundary; WP-03]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: Water Operator; Environmental Officer
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: water_flow_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_6_1_e2" name="Residue disposed">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_8</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_1_n" name="Investigate transfer loss or meter fault">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition). Pumped vs received check; industry convention; no L4 row.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_1_13</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_6_1_e3" name="Transfer exception logged">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_1_13</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_6_1_s" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_1" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_3" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_4" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_5" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_2" targetRef="Par_L3_3_6_1_f"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_6" sourceRef="Par_L3_3_6_1_f" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_7" sourceRef="Par_L3_3_6_1_f" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_8" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_3" targetRef="End_L3_3_6_1_e2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_9" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_4" targetRef="Service_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_5"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_10" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_5" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_11" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g2" targetRef="End_L3_3_6_1_e1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_12" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g2" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_n"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_13" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_1_n" targetRef="End_L3_3_6_1_e3"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_6_1">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_6_1" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_6_1">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_6_1_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_6_1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1788" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_6_1_wat_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_6_1_wat" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="1748" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_6_1_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_6_1_s"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="139" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_1"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="507" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="436" y="34" width="100" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_2"><dc:Bounds x="648" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Par_L3_3_6_1_f_di" bpmnElement="Par_L3_3_6_1_f"><dc:Bounds x="889" y="70" width="70" height="70"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_4_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_4"><dc:Bounds x="1030" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_5_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_5"><dc:Bounds x="1236" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g2_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_6_1_g2" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="1492" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1421" y="20" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_6_1_e1_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_6_1_e1"><dc:Bounds x="1680" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1648" y="139" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_1_3_6_1_3"><dc:Bounds x="1030" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_6_1_e2_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_6_1_e2"><dc:Bounds x="1293" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1261" y="309" width="120" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_1_n_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_1_n"><dc:Bounds x="1442" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_6_1_e3_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_6_1_e3"><dc:Bounds x="1680" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1648" y="309" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_1"><di:waypoint x="198" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_2"><di:waypoint x="436" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="507" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_3"><di:waypoint x="577" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="648" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="581" y="85" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_4"><di:waypoint x="542" y="70"/><di:waypoint x="542" y="40"/><di:waypoint x="1115" y="40"/><di:waypoint x="1115" y="65"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="548" y="52" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_5"><di:waypoint x="818" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="889" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_6"><di:waypoint x="959" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1030" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_7"><di:waypoint x="924" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="924" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="1030" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_8"><di:waypoint x="1200" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="1293" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_9_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_9"><di:waypoint x="1200" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1236" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_10_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_10"><di:waypoint x="1406" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1492" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_11_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_11"><di:waypoint x="1562" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="1680" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1566" y="85" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_12_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_12"><di:waypoint x="1527" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="1527" y="235"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1533" y="144" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_1_13_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_1_13"><di:waypoint x="1612" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="1680" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
